{
  "slug": "release-blog-and-launch-narrative",
  "concept": "Release Blog and Launch Narrative",
  "generated": "2026-09-08",
  "summary": "A launch is a one-shot narrative event — distinct from a landing page (steady-state conversion), an exec memo (internal alignment), or a changelog (continuous release log).",
  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A launch is a one-shot narrative event - distinct from a landing page (steady-state conversion), an exec memo (internal alignment), or a changelog (continuous release log).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#overview",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "1. Four launch archetypes",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Heuristic: If you can't name the archetype in 10 seconds, the launch isn't ready.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#1-four-launch-archetypes",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Beat 1 — Name the shift (the \"why now\")",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Open with a one-paragraph claim about a shift in the world. Never open with the product. Andy Raskin's whole thesis: \"the old game is over; a new game is starting.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#beat-1-name-the-shift-the-why-now",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Beat 2 — Stakes (the cost of the old game)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "What does the reader lose by staying with the old way? Quantify if possible.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#beat-2-stakes-the-cost-of-the-old-game",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Beat 3 — The reveal",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Now - and only now - name the product and the one-line description. Apple's pattern: \"Today, Apple introduced [X], a [category] that [primary benefit].\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#beat-3-the-reveal",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Beat 4 — Proof",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Customer logos, quotes, measurable outcomes, demo link. One outside voice is worth ten internal claims.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#beat-4-proof",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Beat 5 — Call to action and honesty",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Clear CTA - one primary CTA, one secondary at most.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#beat-5-call-to-action-and-honesty",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "What's not in v1 - the honest-disclosure section.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#beat-5-call-to-action-and-honesty",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. The \"why now\" paragraph",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A working \"why now\" paragraph:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#3-the-why-now-paragraph",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Names a shift that has already occurred.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#3-the-why-now-paragraph",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Establishes the cost of operating as if the shift hadn't happened.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#3-the-why-now-paragraph",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Creates urgency that is \"you're already behind if you ignore this.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#3-the-why-now-paragraph",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Template: > Until recently, [old default] was the only way to [task]. But [shift A] and [shift B] have changed what's possible. Teams that adapt are [outcome]. Teams that don't are [cost]. Today we're announcing [product] to help you [verb] in this new world.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#3-the-why-now-paragraph",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Anti-pattern: \"AI is everywhere.\" This is a backdrop, not a why-now. It has no specific shift, no cost, no urgency.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#3-the-why-now-paragraph",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. The cross-channel launch ladder",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Sequencing rules:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#4-the-cross-channel-launch-ladder",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The blog post is the canonical source. Every other piece links to it.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#4-the-cross-channel-launch-ladder",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Analyst and press briefings are under embargo.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#4-the-cross-channel-launch-ladder",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Release notes accompany the announcement. When the blog post says \"today we're launching X,\" the docs and the changelog must already reflect X.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#4-the-cross-channel-launch-ladder",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. The \"what's not in v1\" honesty section",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Template: > v1 deliberately ships without [X], [Y], and [Z]. We chose this scope to get [primary benefit] in your hands sooner. [X] is on the roadmap for [quarter]. If [X] or [Y] is a hard requirement for you today, [alternative path].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#5-the-whats-not-in-v1-honesty-section",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "What this section does: Lets engineers in evaluation mode answer \"can I use this yet?\" without booking a call. Pre-empts the inevitable Hacker News commenter who finds the missing feature.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#5-the-whats-not-in-v1-honesty-section",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "8. Anti-patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The \"we're excited to announce\" opener. Cut. Open with the shift.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#8-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The \"this changes everything\" overclaim.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#8-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The \"product-first\" structure. Specs, then features, then maybe a sentence about who cares.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#8-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The hidden \"what's not in v1.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#8-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The \"AI/cloud/edge is everywhere\" why-now.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#8-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The post that doesn't match the docs.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#8-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The four-CTA ending. If you list four CTAs the reader picks zero.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/release-blog-and-launch-narrative/#8-anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
